#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:4
msgid "結晶の対称操作"
msgstr "Crystal Symmetry Operations"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:6
msgid ""
"結晶に回転や並進を施したとき、同じ種類の原子が同じ位置を占める配置に戻れば、 その変換は結晶の対称操作である。ここでは\\ :ref:`格子行列"
"<lattice-translations>` :math:`A` と\\ :ref:`分率座標<coordinates>`\\ "
"を使い、対称操作で原子がどこへ移るかを求める。"
msgstr ""
"A rotation or translation of a crystal is a symmetry operation if the "
"resulting arrangement has atoms of the same species at the same positions"
" as before. We use the \\ :ref:`lattice matrix <lattice-translations>` "
":math:`A` and \\ :ref:`fractional coordinates <coordinates>`\\  to "
"determine where a symmetry operation moves each atom."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:10
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`格子行列<lattice-translations>` "
":math:`A`、:ref:`分率座標<coordinates>`、:ref:`計量行列<lattice-metric>`、直交行列。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: The :ref:`lattice matrix <lattice-translations>` "
":math:`A`, :ref:`fractional coordinates <coordinates>`, the :ref:`metric "
"tensor <lattice-metric>`, and orthogonal matrices."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:12
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid "回転・鏡映・反転・並進を :math:`\\{Q\\mid\\boldsymbol t\\}` で表し、操作の合成と逆操作を求める。"
msgstr ""
"Represent rotations, reflections, inversions, and translations as "
":math:`\\{Q\\mid\\boldsymbol t\\}`, and find compositions and inverse "
"operations."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:15
msgid "Cartesian座標の操作を分率座標の操作に書き直し、格子を保つ操作の線形部分が整数行列になることを示す。"
msgstr ""
"Rewrite operations from Cartesian coordinates in fractional coordinates "
"and show that the linear part of a lattice-preserving operation is an "
"integer matrix."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:16
msgid "分率座標で原子を移し、周期像まで含めて配置が重なるかで対称操作かどうかを判定する。"
msgstr ""
"Move the atoms in fractional coordinates and determine whether the "
"transformation is a symmetry operation by checking if the arrangements "
"coincide, including periodic images."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:19
msgid "回転・鏡映・反転・並進"
msgstr "Rotations, Reflections, Inversions, and Translations"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:21
msgid ""
"Cartesian座標では位置 :math:`\\boldsymbol r` への操作を 直交行列 :math:`Q` と並進ベクトル "
":math:`\\boldsymbol t` の組で表す。"
msgstr ""
"In Cartesian coordinates, we represent an operation on a position "
":math:`\\boldsymbol r` by pairing an orthogonal matrix :math:`Q` with a "
"translation vector :math:`\\boldsymbol t`:"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"g=\\{Q\\mid\\boldsymbol t\\},\\qquad\n"
"g\\boldsymbol r=Q\\boldsymbol r+\\boldsymbol t"
msgstr ""
"g=\\{Q\\mid\\boldsymbol t\\},\\qquad\n"
"g\\boldsymbol r=Q\\boldsymbol r+\\boldsymbol t"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`Q^{\\mathsf T}Q=I` なので、操作を受けた2点の距離は変わらない。 原点を通る :math:`z` "
"軸のまわりの90度回転は :math:`(x,y,z)\\mapsto(-y,x,z)`、 :math:`xy` 面での鏡映は "
":math:`(x,y,z)\\mapsto(x,y,-z)` である。 原点を中心とする反転は :math:`Q=-I`、純粋な並進は "
":math:`Q=I` に対応する。 軸や中心の位置が原点からずれているときは、同じ線形部分を持つ操作でも :math:`\\boldsymbol"
" t` が加わる。例えば :math:`\\boldsymbol c` を中心とする反転は :math:`\\boldsymbol "
"r\\mapsto 2\\boldsymbol c-\\boldsymbol r` である。"
msgstr ""
"Since :math:`Q^{\\mathsf T}Q=I`, the operation preserves the distance "
"between two points. A 90° rotation about the :math:`z` axis through the "
"origin gives the mapping :math:`(x,y,z)\\mapsto(-y,x,z)`. A reflection in"
" the :math:`xy` plane gives :math:`(x,y,z)\\mapsto(x,y,-z)`. Inversion "
"about the origin corresponds to :math:`Q=-I` and a pure translation to "
":math:`Q=I`. When the axis or center is displaced from the origin, a "
"translation :math:`\\boldsymbol t` is added even for an operation with "
"the same linear part. For example, inversion about :math:`\\boldsymbol c`"
" gives :math:`\\boldsymbol r\\mapsto 2\\boldsymbol c-\\boldsymbol r`."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:38
msgid ""
":numref:`fig-crystal-symmetry-operations`\\ では、回転・鏡映・反転で点のどの成分が "
"変わるかを座標面への投影で比べる。"
msgstr ""
"The projections onto the coordinate planes in :numref:`fig-crystal-"
"symmetry-operations`\\  show which coordinates of a point change under "
"rotation, reflection, and inversion."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:41
msgid "左の90度回転ではzが変わらず、中央の鏡映ではzだけ符号が変わる。右の原点での反転ではx、y、zの符号がすべて変わり、xz面では右上から左下へ移る。"
msgstr ""
"In the 90° rotation on the left, z stays the same. In the reflection in "
"the middle, only z changes sign. In the inversion about the origin on the"
" right, x, y, and z all change sign, and the point moves from upper right"
" to lower left in the xz plane."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:47
msgid ""
"白抜きの丸が変換前、塗りつぶした丸が変換後の点。左は :math:`z` 軸回りの90度回転を :math:`xy` 面に投影した図。中央と右は "
":math:`xz` 面への投影で、中央の水平の破線は 鏡映面との交線である。右の反転では :math:`z` の符号も変わる。"
msgstr ""
"Open circles show the points before transformation, and filled circles "
"show the transformed points. Left: a 90° rotation about the :math:`z` "
"axis projected onto the :math:`xy` plane. The middle and right panels "
"show projections onto the :math:`xz` plane. The horizontal dashed line in"
" the middle panel is its intersection with the mirror plane. In the "
"inversion on the right, :math:`z` also changes sign."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:52
msgid "操作の合成と逆操作"
msgstr "Composition of Operations and Inverse Operations"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:54
msgid ""
":math:`g_2` のあとに :math:`g_1` を施すと、後から行う線形変換は 先に行った並進にも作用する。式 :eq"
":`crystal-symmetry-affine` を順に適用すると、"
msgstr ""
"When :math:`g_2` is followed by :math:`g_1`, the second linear "
"transformation acts on the first translation as well. Applying Equation "
":eq:`crystal-symmetry-affine` in sequence gives"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:57
msgid ""
"g_1g_2=\\{Q_1Q_2\\mid Q_1\\boldsymbol t_2+\\boldsymbol t_1\\},\\qquad\n"
"g^{-1}=\\{Q^{-1}\\mid -Q^{-1}\\boldsymbol t\\}"
msgstr ""
"g_1g_2=\\{Q_1Q_2\\mid Q_1\\boldsymbol t_2+\\boldsymbol t_1\\},\\qquad\n"
"g^{-1}=\\{Q^{-1}\\mid -Q^{-1}\\boldsymbol t\\}"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"を得る。逆操作では並進を取り消してから :math:`Q^{-1}` を作用させる。 "
"結晶を保つ操作を合成しても結晶は保たれ、どの操作にも逆操作がある。 これらの操作全体が結晶の\\ :ref:`空間群<crystal-space-"
"group>`\\ をなす。"
msgstr ""
"To apply the inverse operation, undo the translation first, then apply "
":math:`Q^{-1}`. Composing operations that preserve the crystal still "
"preserves the crystal, and each operation has an inverse. The set of all "
"these operations forms the crystal's \\ :ref:`space group <crystal-space-"
"group>`\\ ."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:68
msgid "分率座標での対称操作"
msgstr "Symmetry Operations in Fractional Coordinates"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:70
msgid ""
"分率座標 :math:`\\boldsymbol s` では :math:`\\boldsymbol r=A\\boldsymbol s` "
"である。 式 :eq:`crystal-symmetry-affine` に代入すると、"
msgstr ""
"In fractional coordinates :math:`\\boldsymbol s`, the position is "
":math:`\\boldsymbol r=A\\boldsymbol s`. Substitution into Equation :eq"
":`crystal-symmetry-affine` gives"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol s'=W\\boldsymbol s+\\boldsymbol u,\\qquad\n"
"W=A^{-1}QA,\\qquad\n"
"\\boldsymbol u=A^{-1}\\boldsymbol t"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol s'=W\\boldsymbol s+\\boldsymbol u,\\qquad\n"
"W=A^{-1}QA,\\qquad\n"
"\\boldsymbol u=A^{-1}\\boldsymbol t"

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:80
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"となる。基本並進ベクトルを列にもつ :math:`A` を使う場合、対称操作の線形部分は 格子の並進をまた格子の並進に移すので、:math:`W`"
" の列は整数である。逆操作についても 同じことが言え、:math:`\\det W=\\pm1` になる。また、\\ :ref:`計量行列"
"<lattice-metric>` :math:`G=A^{\\mathsf T}A` に 対して :math:`W^{\\mathsf "
"T}GW=G` が成り立つ。この条件で格子を保つ候補を絞り、 式 :eq:`crystal-symmetry-fractional` "
"で原子を移して、元素ごとの配置が周期像まで含めて 重なるかを確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"When :math:`A` has primitive translation vectors as its columns, the "
"linear part of a symmetry operation maps lattice translations to lattice "
"translations, so the columns of :math:`W` contain integers. The same "
"applies to the inverse operation, which implies :math:`\\det W=\\pm1`. "
"For the \\ :ref:`metric tensor <lattice-metric>` :math:`G=A^{\\mathsf "
"T}A`, we also have :math:`W^{\\mathsf T}GW=G`. Use this condition to "
"narrow down the operations that preserve the lattice. Then move the atoms"
" using Equation :eq:`crystal-symmetry-fractional` and check whether the "
"positions of each species coincide, including periodic images."

#: ../../solid/symmetry_operations.rst:87
msgid ""
"例えば立方慣用単位胞の分率座標で、:math:`z` 軸まわりの90度回転を :math:`(1/4,1/2,0)` に施すと "
":math:`(-1/2,1/4,0)` になる。第1成分に整数の1を足せば :math:`(1/2,1/4,0)` "
"となる。この位置に同じ元素の原子があり、他の原子も同様に対応する とき、その回転は原子配置の対称操作である。"
msgstr ""
"For example, in fractional coordinates of a cubic conventional cell, a "
"90° rotation about the :math:`z` axis takes :math:`(1/4,1/2,0)` to "
":math:`(-1/2,1/4,0)`. Adding the integer 1 to the first component gives "
":math:`(1/2,1/4,0)`. The rotation is a symmetry operation of the atomic "
"arrangement if an atom of the same element occupies this position and "
"every other atom maps to a corresponding atom in the same way."

